                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6bacdc04-afb2-3d2c-9bf7-22a3da5e2ffe",
                        "entry_id": "14cc6aac-3082-351b-822c-1af4288e0675",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Person, die eklig und unausstehlich ist"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f42da43-5f96-4295-be20-75dae1afec9e",
                                "sense_id": "6bacdc04-afb2-3d2c-9bf7-22a3da5e2ffe",
                                "text": "Ich kann diesen aufgeblasenen Kotzbrocken nicht ausstehen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2be93a8e-4256-4fed-9f78-1be699528474",
                                "sense_id": "6bacdc04-afb2-3d2c-9bf7-22a3da5e2ffe",
                                "text": "„Sein ‚Don Giovanni‘ (1787) ist kein leichtfüßiger Verführer, sondern ein Kotzbrocken, der die Frauen mit Gewalt und falschen Versprechungen zum Sex zwingt.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0d0fbba-befa-437f-b902-d8638a4eae84",
                                "sense_id": "6bacdc04-afb2-3d2c-9bf7-22a3da5e2ffe",
                                "text": "„Wir übten am Rand und hielten uns fest, wenn uns die Kräfte verließen oder wenn irgendein Kotzbrocken im Delphinstil das Wasser aufwühlte, so daß man in den Wellen fast ersoff.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0b9b679-1ed6-400f-ac27-71531eb9a1e8",
                                "sense_id": "6bacdc04-afb2-3d2c-9bf7-22a3da5e2ffe",
                                "text": "„Dass die Promis, die Reichen und Schönen, bisweilen einen Knall haben, überkandidelt sind und manchmal zu den Kotzbrocken der Gesellschaft zählen, ist nichts Neues.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa4790a4-fce5-4d0a-8e71-53f172fd1d01",
                                "sense_id": "6bacdc04-afb2-3d2c-9bf7-22a3da5e2ffe",
                                "text": "„Donald Trump beschimpft James Comey als »Kotzbrocken«.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "59eb290d-b81e-4b93-9d4a-5f9d43fa86f5",
                                "sense_id": "6bacdc04-afb2-3d2c-9bf7-22a3da5e2ffe",
                                "text": "„Wichtig für ihre weiteren Auftritte in der Öffentlichkeit sind die Spuren, die die Camper [in der Fernsehsendung 'Dschungelcamp'] hinterlassen, egal ob als Kotzbrocken oder Sympath - dementsprechend werden sie gebucht.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "078dd696-0a22-47a3-b011-5d9fccd83cdc",
                        "source_entry_id": "14cc6aac-3082-351b-822c-1af4288e0675",
                        "source_sense_id": "6bacdc04-afb2-3d2c-9bf7-22a3da5e2ffe",
                        "source_sense_description": "abwertend: Person, die eklig und unausstehlich ist",
                        "target_lang_word": "slimeball",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "slimeball",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "479d7d94-68da-3ffb-99ba-0d5d7d26113c",
                                        "entry_id": "8c724834-317f-34ac-978e-d02ff797ff40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A round lump made up of or coated with slime or a slime-like substance such as mucus."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb962ec1-11a9-3697-8b48-0fd58923bf22",
                                        "entry_id": "8c724834-317f-34ac-978e-d02ff797ff40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A round lump made up of or coated with slime or a slime-like substance such as mucus.",
                                            "A mucus-coated lump containing the cercariae (“parasitic larvae”) of a liver fluke (of the phylum Platyhelminthes)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "specifically"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5560ef18-e86a-4301-8e11-7c80c949b725",
                                                "sense_id": "eb962ec1-11a9-3697-8b48-0fd58923bf22",
                                                "text": "The eggs [of a lancet fluke (Dicrocoelium dendriticum)] that pass out with the manure of an infested sheep do not hatch in the open. When eaten by the snail, they hatch and finally give rise to larvae that pass out of the snail's body in gelatinous \"slime[-]balls.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e0b76b3-38f8-4644-ac34-348b8b680631",
                                                "sense_id": "eb962ec1-11a9-3697-8b48-0fd58923bf22",
                                                "text": "The cercariae contain massive glands, formerly considered to be penetration glands, but now believed to produce the slime responsible for the formation of these balls. It is likely that the slime produced by the snail itself may contribute, at least partly, to the formation of a slimeball."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c8b88e3-7281-4de4-939a-64e4c599c313",
                                                "sense_id": "eb962ec1-11a9-3697-8b48-0fd58923bf22",
                                                "text": "These flukes have three hosts. [...] As the infected snail crawls along it leaves slime balls containing cercaria on grass. An ant, Formica fusca, the arthropod host for D. dendriticum in the United States, is infected when it ingests the slime balls. Mammals are infected by consuming ants containing encysted metacercaria."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36223353-bb0e-388f-a19f-d49325c42734",
                                        "entry_id": "8c724834-317f-34ac-978e-d02ff797ff40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is slimy (that is, sneaky or underhanded) or otherwise undesirable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e7ae5f2-869f-43a5-b53b-6b603fe3dd11",
                                                "sense_id": "36223353-bb0e-388f-a19f-d49325c42734",
                                                "text": "Even slimeballs were entitled to representation, though."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe6ef4b1-a649-44a0-a30d-85ca36b2b578",
                                                "sense_id": "36223353-bb0e-388f-a19f-d49325c42734",
                                                "text": "And I put my hands on her jugs. She goes crazy. She says 'Take your hands off me slimeball!' So I go, 'Rona, watch your language!' And she goes, 'If you wanna have fun with your hands, why don't you pass the time playin' solitaire.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93bdfe68-d37f-4327-a594-4f20eef85260",
                                                "sense_id": "36223353-bb0e-388f-a19f-d49325c42734",
                                                "text": "[T]here will always be spies, and spooks, and counterspooks. Some of these slimeballs are perhaps breaking into Pentagon computers at this very moment, finding the dirty pictures some bored programmer stored on a corner of the hard disk."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a693e9c-cc4d-4c0e-9bac-05ad1c3e876e",
                                                "sense_id": "36223353-bb0e-388f-a19f-d49325c42734",
                                                "text": "He cursed Flak, then watched with horror as the slimeball explained to the world exactly how he, Kerber, had obtained the confession."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd864bfc-4165-44cc-b2ad-07e82b95643e",
                                                "sense_id": "36223353-bb0e-388f-a19f-d49325c42734",
                                                "text": "He said it would be good for me, going to Grimsby; my hideous, horrible, sewer-minded, greeneyed slimeball of a two-faced, felonious bastard of an uncle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46ffe94a-e382-4f76-8ef6-029ebdf8aee8",
                                                "sense_id": "36223353-bb0e-388f-a19f-d49325c42734",
                                                "text": "Meanwhile, the film's villain, played by Ben Mendelsohn, is a bigwig slimeball who wants to monopolize and monetize The Oasis through excessive pop-up ads. His true crime, though, is that he's a total noob who doesn't know his stuff."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
